\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.1}{\ignorespaces High-level system architecture showing the eight pipeline stages from query input to response output.}}{18}{}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.2}{\ignorespaces Hybrid retrieval component architecture showing BM25 and dense retrieval paths, RRF fusion, source diversity filtering, and dynamic-$k$ selection.}}{20}{}%
